<div class="row mb-5" id="components">

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Module Components</h2>
        <p class="mb-4">
            Our manufacturing suite integrates all production and supporting departments into a 
            unified industrial ecosystem.
        </p>
        <div class="row">
            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/dashboard">Dashboard</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Real-time visualization of production OEE, work-in-progress (WIP) levels, 
                    machine downtime, and quality yield metrics across the factory floor.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/billofmaterials">Bill of Materials (BOM)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Management of multi-level product recipes, component substitutions, version 
                    control, and automated cost rollup reporting.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/planning">Planning & Scheduling</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Master Production Schedule (MPS) and Material Requirements Planning (MRP) engine 
                    to optimize procurement and production lead times.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/shopfloor">Shop Floor Control</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Real-time work order dispatch, worker time-at-station tracking, job card printing, 
                    and machine downtime logging.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/qualitycontrol">Quality Control (QC)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Inspection plan enforcement, test result capture (GMP/WHO), non-conformance 
                    workflows, and Certificate of Analysis (CoA) generation.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/traceability">Batch Traceability</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Full forward and backward genealogy from raw material receipt to end-customer 
                    delivery. Critical for pharmaceutical and food safety recalls.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/costing">Product Costing (WIP)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Precision tracking of material consumption, labor hours, and overheads to 
                    calculate actual vs. standard production costs.
                </p>
            </div>

            <div class="col-md-6 col-lg-4 mb-4">
                <h3 class="h5 fw-semibold mb-2"><a href="/manufacturing/maintenance">Maintenance (EAM)</a></h3>
                <p class="small">
                    Asset management for factory equipment including planned maintenance schedules, 
                    repair logs, and spare parts inventory tracking.
                </p>
            </div>
        </div>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Architectural Production Planning</h2>
        <p>
            Transform demand into feasible production reality with our planning engine. Pindah 
            Manufacturing's Material Requirements Planning (MRP) system calculates exactly 
            what to buy and when to start production, based on current sales orders, lead 
            times, and existing stock levels. By optimizing the production sequence to 
            minimize changeovers and maximize machine utilization, our planning tools 
            ensure that your facility operates at peak efficiency while maintaining 
            lean inventory levels.
        </p>
        <p>
            Capacity planning by work center ensures that schedules are always achievable, 
            identifying potential labor or machine bottlenecks before they impact 
            customer delivery dates.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Precision Engineering & BOM Management</h2>
        <p>
            Maintain absolute recipe integrity with our multi-level Bill of Materials (BOM) 
            manager. Whether you are managing chemical formulas for pharmaceuticals or 
            assembly instructions for heavy industry, the system ensures that the 
            correct ingredients and quantities are used in every batch. Sophisticated 
            version control with effective dating prevents the use of obsolete 
            recipes, while component substitution rules provide production 
            flexibility without compromising product quality.
        </p>
        <p>
            Automated cost rollup reporting identifies the financial impact of raw material 
            price shifts instantly, allowing for rapid pricing adjustments in the 
            market.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Shop Floor Execution & Transparency</h2>
        <p>
            Drive productivity through real-time shop floor visibility. Work orders are dispatched 
            electronically to specific work centers, where operators report progress, 
            material consumption, and scrap quantities directly. Production travelers 
            and job cards provide the physical instructions needed at the station, while 
            the central dashboard provides leadership with a live view of OEE 
            (Overall Equipment Effectiveness) and potential downtime incidents as 
            they occur.
        </p>
        <p>
            This high-fidelity data capture provides the empirical basis for labor 
            productivity analysis and precise job costing, identifying the true 
            profitability of every production run.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

<div class="row mb-5">
    <div class="col-lg-12">
        <h2 class="h3 fw-bold mb-4">Regulatory Compliance & Genealogy</h2>
        <p>
            Secure your regulatory "Right to Operate" in highly sensitive industries. Pindah 
            Manufacturing enforce WHO GMP and MCAZ standards through locked-down quality 
            control workflows and non-conformance staging. In the event of a quality 
            incident, our Batch Traceability engine provides immediate forward and 
            backward genealogy, identifying exactly which raw material batches were 
            used and which customers received the finished product.
        </p>
        <p>
            From quarantine management of incoming chemicals to the automated generation of 
            Certificates of Analysis (CoA), our platform ensures that your quality 
            assurance mission is hard-wired into the production lifecycle.
        </p>
    </div>
</div>

